# Ignore everything in deploy/ except tracked scripts, config and notes
*
!.gitignore
# The installer's "What's New" page and the portable ZIP's README.txt.
!RELEASENOTES.txt
!README_portable.txt

# The clean-machine install harness. The directory has to be re-included before its
# contents, because git will not descend into an excluded directory at all. Its own
# .gitignore ignores the generated .work/ payload, and a nested rule wins over this one.
!sandbox/
!sandbox/**

# The release package (build_avalonia_package.ps1), the same way: its own .gitignore keeps
# the staged layout and the packages out.
!avalonia/
!avalonia/**
